    "bulletList": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>CrossFire 2 offers revolutionary resection capability and enhanced ablation in one complete arthroscopy solution by providing you with the ability to operate shaver and RF functionality in one console.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>The CrossFire 2 console and footswitch control SERFAS energy probes, Formula Series hand pieces, and TPS Small Joint hand pieces. CrossFire 2 also integrates with the CrossFlow pump, optimizing fluid flow when the two are used together. This eliminates the need for multiple foot switches and consoles that clutter up OR space.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>A completely customizable interface eliminates the need to switch individual settings between cases.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      }
    }
  },
